The '''Knifethrower''' is a type of [[Mob]] and [[Goblin (disambiguation)|Goblin]] that spawns in the {{Zone|Dwarven Mines}} and {{Zone|Crystal Hollows}}.

== Spawning ==
'''Knifethrowers''' spawn naturally in the {{Zone|Goblin Burrows}} of the {{Zone|Dwarven Mines}} and the {{Zone|Goblin Holdout}} of the {{Zone|Crystal Hollows}}.

== Behavior ==
'''Knifethrowers''' throw knives as ranged attacks.

== Drops ==
'''Knifethrowers''' have a {{odds|rare|nameonly=y}} ({{Green|5%}}) chance to drop a bag of coins holding {{c|500|10000}}. The player will be notified in the chat over the drop and the amount.
